    "@value": "Named with the design team on the Europaconcorsi project page (Internet Archive snapshot) and in a cited master's thesis; collaborator role and design-team role confirmed by the author and by baires.eu; Perugia role from the organiser's poster supplied by the author; identity of the two records confirmed by the author"
